前端开发工程师.answer:
参考实现：
function flatten(arr) {
  const res = [];
  for (const item of arr) {
    if (Array.isArray(item)) {
      res.push(...flatten(item));
    } else {
      res.push(item);
    }
  }
  return res;
}
时间复杂度 O(n)，n 为所有元素总数（每个元素访问一次）；递归深度为嵌套层数，空间复杂度 O(n) 存放结果，递归栈为 O(深度)。也可用栈迭代实现避免深层递归爆栈。

参考实现：
function limitRun(tasks, limit) {
  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
    const results = new Array(tasks.length);
    let nextIndex = 0, running = 0, finished = 0;
    if (tasks.length === 0) return resolve([]);
    function run() {
      if (nextIndex >= tasks.length) return;
      const i = nextIndex++;
      running++;
      Promise.resolve()
        .then(() => tasks[i]())
        .then(val => {
          results[i] = val;
          running--; finished++;
          if (finished === tasks.length) resolve(results);
          else run();
        }, reject);
    }
    for (let k = 0; k < Math.min(limit, tasks.length); k++) run();
  });
}
关键点：用 nextIndex 记录下一个待取任务，running 控制并发，finished 统计完成数，结果按索引写入保证顺序。

